    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES SUMMARY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Full story (40 levels) and challenge mode (6 levels) with 20 unique machines and 11 types of crop!<br></li><li>Intense multitasking action: cook recipes, tend animals, grow crops, and keep an eye on the Hazard Bar too!<br></li><li>Cheerful storyline with endearing characters and hilarious dialogues!<br></li><li>Special non-timed 'Casual Mode' for all the family to enjoy the game!<br></li><li>Travel through 6 wonderful stages with unique art styles and music themes!<br></li><li>19 unique achievements!</li></ul><br>DISCOVER A LUXURIOUS AND COLORED UNIVERSE!<br>You will experience an incredible adventure through Barney's meadows to learn the basics of the Flying Farm, then fly to the skies in the level of the Flying Islets and then dive into the Ocean, discover the Great Volcano and land on the Moon!!<br><br>MEET UNIQUE CHARACTERS!<br>To help you manage Barney's farm, Marvin the smart robot will be your most loyal ally, he never breaks down! Heather will also be there to take care of you if you\u2019re in trouble.<br>Rescue the Baby starling, meet the Fishmen under the ocean, the Magmen of the Great Volcano and let yourself be guided by the Flying Farm to the Star King!<br>Many surprises await you...<br><br>COOK UNIQUE RECIPES!<br>Who has never dreamt of creating unique dishes? In &quot;The Flying Farm&quot;, thanks to Marvin, Barney and Heather, it's possible!<br>Examples? Have you ever tasted Starmilk? Some Moltegg maybe? Let yourself be tempted by the Cloud candy or even the Volcanocakes! Or for the fearless, Explomatoes!!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES SUMMARY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Full story (40 levels) and challenge mode (6 levels) with 20 unique machines and 11 types of crop!<br></li><li>Intense multitasking action: cook recipes, tend animals, grow crops, and keep an eye on the Hazard Bar too!<br></li><li>Cheerful storyline with endearing characters and hilarious dialogues!<br></li><li>Special non-timed 'Casual Mode' for all the family to enjoy the game!<br></li><li>Travel through 6 wonderful stages with unique art styles and music themes!<br></li><li>19 unique achievements!</li></ul><br>DISCOVER A LUXURIOUS AND COLORED UNIVERSE!<br>You will experience an incredible adventure through Barney's meadows to learn the basics of the Flying Farm, then fly to the skies in the level of the Flying Islets and then dive into the Ocean, discover the Great Volcano and land on the Moon!!<br><br>MEET UNIQUE CHARACTERS!<br>To help you manage Barney's farm, Marvin the smart robot will be your most loyal ally, he never breaks down! Heather will also be there to take care of you if you\u2019re in trouble.<br>Rescue the Baby starling, meet the Fishmen under the ocean, the Magmen of the Great Volcano and let yourself be guided by the Flying Farm to the Star King!<br>Many surprises await you...<br><br>COOK UNIQUE RECIPES!<br>Who has never dreamt of creating unique dishes? In &quot;The Flying Farm&quot;, thanks to Marvin, Barney and Heather, it's possible!<br>Examples? Have you ever tasted Starmilk? Some Moltegg maybe? Let yourself be tempted by the Cloud candy or even the Volcanocakes! Or for the fearless, Explomatoes!!",
    "short_description": "Epic Journey to the moon, rescue the Baby Starling! Travel the world and help Barney the farmer to bring back the baby star to his parents in this captivating time management game. This won't be easy, as you'll travel in the sky, in the ocean or on a blazing hot volcano before reaching the Moon!",
